  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irida: Safe space for 650 women at risk in Greece</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More than 1 in 4 women in Greece are at risk of poverty and social exclusion. At Irida, we work with these women who lack opportunities for a safe life and sustainable future for themselves and their children. Through protection, legal, psychosocial support and employability services, we ensure while working with commitment and determination that no woman is left behind.</narrative>
  </description>
